 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I have told you these things while I am still with you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The word you hear is not mine but the Father's who sent me",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you do not love me you do not keep my words",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Advocate the Holy Spirit is near",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peace I leave with you my peace I give to you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I do not give to you as the world gives",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not let your hearts be troubled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid in this moment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am going away and I am coming back to you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you loved me you would rejoice that I am going to the Father",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Father is greater than I",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have told you now before it happens",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peace I leave with you my peace I give to you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I do not give to you as the world gives",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not let your hearts be troubled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid in this moment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that when it does happen you will believe",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The ruler of this world is coming",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has no claim on me",
   "heard": 6,
